WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.037
Break and continue let us change the normal flow of a loop.

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:09.377
Continue skips the rest of the current repetition and moves to the next one.

00:00:09.377 --> 00:00:13.227
In the first example, the number two is skipped.

00:00:13.227 --> 00:00:16.167
Break exits the loop completely.

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:21.701
In the second example, once the number reaches four, the loop stops immediately.

00:00:22.201 --> 00:00:25.238
These tools are useful, but use them carefully.

00:00:25.238 --> 00:00:29.867
If a loop becomes hard to follow, simpler logic is usually better.
